OL,3,GNEWSACare board merger postponed until
OL,4,A2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn MP said he welcomed the postponement
OL,7,Fof merger plans for two Integrated Care
OL,8,FBoards (ICBs).
OL,10,FGovernment proposals to merge Devon and
OL,11,FCornwall's ICBs have been postponed
OL,12,Funtil at least 2028, "pending wider
OL,13,Fdiscussions on devolution and future
OL,14,Fpublic service arrangements".
OL,16,FBen Maguire, MP for North Cornwall,
OL,17,Fsaid he was "very hopeful" the plans
OL,18,Fwould then be scrapped permanently.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34302
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F343A1791581123
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSACare board merger postponed until
OL,4,A2028
OL,5,
OL,6,F"My constituents were rightly worried
OL,7,Fthat a merged ICB would see decisions
OL,8,Fmade in Plymouth and Exeter, taking
OL,9,Fpower away from the patients and
OL,10,Fcommunities it is supposed to
OL,11,Frepresent," he said.
